OL,3,GNEWSAReport finds 'no malicious intent'
OL,4,Ain Eljamel logbooks destruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe destruction of 40 logbooks
OL,7,Fpotentially relating to disgraced
OL,8,Fsurgeon Sam Eljamel was the result of
OL,9,F"inadequate systems and processes"
OL,10,Frather than deliberate wrongdoing, a
OL,11,Freport has found.
OL,13,FEljamel, who was head of neurosurgery
OL,14,Fat Dundee's Ninewells Hospital until
OL,15,Fhis suspension in December 2013, harmed
OL,16,Fdozens of patients and left some with
OL,17,Flife-changing injuries.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
