OL,3,GNEWSAReport finds 'no malicious intent'
OL,4,Ain Eljamel logbooks destruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe theatre logbooks were destroyed in
OL,7,FJuly 2025 despite a do not destroy
OL,8,F(DND) notice having been in place since
OL,9,FOctober 2024 in relation to a public
OL,10,Finquiry into the surgeon., external
OL,12,FNHS Tayside said it accepted the
OL,13,Freport's findings, external in full and
OL,14,Fhas published an action plan to deal
OL,15,Fwith the report's 15 recommendations.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
